                <span id="scopeNote">
                    <dt>Scope Note</dt><dd>A basic polypeptide isolated from Streptomyces netropsis. It is cytotoxic and its strong, specific binding to A-T areas of <a href="/record/ui?ui=D004247" class="textLink_DNA">DNA</a> is useful to genetics research.</dd>
                </span>
            
